{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And the cattle of the Levites, etc.</b> The cattle of the Levites did not redeem the firstborn of clean cattle of Israel, but their firstborn donkeys. And one lamb of a Levite's firstborn exempted as many firstborn donkeys of Israel as there were. Know this — for He counted the excess among the people, but did not count the excess among the cattle (ibid. 4)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:16.404749117Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}